<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>General Tennis Etiquette</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Members/Guests entering the court should wait for a break in play before walking onto the court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>To retrieve or return a ball to the neighbouring court, please wait for a break in play before passing the ball back or walking onto the opposite court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Baskets of balls are only permitted on court for Members serving practice or club coaching staff lessons. Members and Guests are not permitted to feed balls or coach during court time, unless authorized by Club Management</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Cell phones must be turned to silent. Texting is allowed on court. Out of courtesy to the neighbouring court, phone calls should be taken off court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Airpods are acceptable on court, over the ear or wired headphones are prohibited</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>The walls and glass surrounding the courts are NOT to be used as a hitting wall</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>General Rules</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Only tennis Members and registered Guests are permitted on court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ensure all sessions/hits end in a timely manner to allow for on-coming Members/Guests to start on the hour</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>All guests must check in with the Front Desk or 4th floor desk prior to stepping on court, any Guest bypassing check in may be removed from the tennis court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Tennis Court Bookings</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Singles bookings - 60-minutes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>2 names required at time of booking​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Doubles bookings - 60-minutes or 120-minutes</p>
