<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Back-to-back reservations are not permitted (please refer to Same-Day Booking below)</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ball machine booking may only be reserved on court 2</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Same-Day Booking(from 12:00am via 10XTO app)</p>
