<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Private lessons and ball machine bookings will be allowed in primetime</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Allows for back-to-back reservations</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Booking Policies | SECTIONAL MEMBERS</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Primetime Tennis</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Monday - Friday 6:00pm - 10:00pm</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Saturday & Sunday 9:00am - 1:00pm</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Primetime court time is reserved for Members with a tennis sectional only. Non-sectional Members and Member Guests cannot reserve court time during Primetime hours.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Booking Policies</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Maximum "Primetime" Bookings: Members have a maximum of 2 Primetime bookings</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Maximum "Non-Primetime" Bookings: Members have a maximum of 3 non-primetime bookings within a rolling 6-day period for a total of 5 bookings, and must be allocated accordingly</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>For example: cannot convert to 4 primetime bookings and 1 non-primetime booking or 0 primetime bookings and 5 non-primetime bookings​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Advanced bookings: Sectional holders may reserve courts up to 6-days in advance</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Booking Policies | NON-SECTIONAL MEMBERS</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Court fees apply</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Maximum "Non-Primetime" Bookings: Members have a maximum of 3 non-primetime bookings within a rolling 6-day period</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Advanced Bookings: Non-sectional Members may reserve courts up to 3 days in advance</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guest Policies</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guests are able to visit up to 6 times in a calendar year</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guests must check in at the front desk or 4th floor desk prior to accessing the facility amenities</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Tennis bookings involving guest(s) may only reserve a court 3-days in advance</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guest(s) are not permitted in primetime hours unless reserved on the same-day</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guest(s) must adhere to all 10XTO attire and etiquette protocols</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Cancellation Policy</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Court bookings may be cancelled no less than 12 hours prior from the reserved booking time</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Members will be charged $40/hr for late cancellations​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>No shows for court bookings will be charged $50/hr​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Private lessons and clinics must be cancelled 24 hours prior to the start of the lesson or clinic</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Late clinic cancellation will result in clinic fee ($30)</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Please note, applicable taxes not included.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>'Gaming the System' Infraction Policy</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>‘Gaming the System’ refers to circumventing the tennis court booking policies, whether intentional or not</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Suspicious patterns are subject to review and may be deemed ‘Gaming the System’</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Examples (but not limited to) include:</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Bookings made under another Member’s name​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>2 hours Doubles bookings and only 2 or 3 players showing up</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ball machine court reserved and adjusted to 1-on-1 member play</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Booking a court in primetime and adjusting on the same day to bring in a guest</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>A member allowing their name to be used for purposes of booking courts with no intention or ability to play at that time</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>When deemed a ‘Gaming the System’ infraction, members will be penalized with the following series of escalating penalties:</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>1st Offence: Warning email from Director of Tennis and any applicable fees (late cancellations/no show)​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>2nd Offence: 1-week tennis suspension. Member will have booking privilege removed for a period of 1-week (includes: tennis social/clinics and lessons)</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>3rd Offence: 1-month tennis suspension. Member will have booking privilege removed for a period of 1-month (includes: tennis social/clinics and lessons)</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Offence count will reset each calendar year</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Tennis Attire</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Proper tennis attire is required for all Members and Guests</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Footwear: Non-marking tennis shoes only</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Men: Collared polo-styled tennis shirts, crew-collared tennis shirts, tennis themed t-shirts, and outerwear are acceptable. Tennis shorts are expected</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Tank tops, sleeveless shirts, and jeans are not acceptable​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Women: Tank tops, crew-collared tennis shirts, dresses or leggings are expected​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Sports bras, jeans are not acceptable​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>The Club reserves the right to remove any player who fails to meet 10XTO tennis attire standards.​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Waitlist Access Policies​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Same day court bookings​​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Same day clinic bookings</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Court reservations with sectional tennis Members must follow "Same Day" booking policies</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>SQUASH POLICIES</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>General Squash Etiquette</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Members must wear proper, non-marking court shoes and proper court attire when on court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Players under the age of 19 must wear eye guards at all times when using the courts. Eye guards are highly encouraged for all players</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Offer "lets" and "strokes" when you obstruct play</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Call your own double bounces, out of court shots, tins and carries</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Compromise with a "let" when in dispute</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Leave the court willingly when your court booking has expired</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Respect your opponent and the game</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Courts may be booked up to 7 days in advance</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>A Member may book in advance 1 singles court time and 1 doubles court time per day</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>All names, including guests are required to be on the court booking</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Singles court bookings are 45 minutes, doubles court bookings are 1 hour</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Juniors</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Juniors may book singles courts up to 2 days in advance. Juniors may book singles courts at any time any day of the week when booking same day courts</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>May book up to 1 day in advance for the doubles court</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Private/Semi-Private lessons: 24 hour notice is required</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>If a Member cancels within 24 hours, they will be charged the full lesson fee + HST​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Clinics: 24 hour notice is required​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>If a Member cancels within 24 hours, they will be charged the full clinic fee + HST​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Court Bookings: 12 hour notice is required​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>First cancellation within 12 hours will result in a warning to the Member​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Second cancellation within 12 hours will result in the Member being charged the court fee + HST</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Squash Court Maintenance Concerns</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Courts may be taken out of service from time to time for maintenance or special events. Every effort will be made to provide advance warning.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>FITNESS POLICIES</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Fitness Floor Etiquette</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>10XTO Personal Trainers and Fitness Instructors are the only authorized professionals to provide coaching, nutritional consultation and/or program design within the Club</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>We strongly encourage all Members to complete a fitness orientation with one of our Fitness Professionals prior to starting a new exercise program</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Secure all personal items, including fitness bags in the lockers provided located in the respective change rooms before visiting the fitness floor</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Replace equipment to the designated location when finished</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Wipe down equipment after each use with the disinfectant wipes provided throughout the fitness floor</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Only secured, non-glass containers are permitted in the Club</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Members and Guests are required to wear appropriate athletic attire with athletic shoes while on the fitness floor</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Please be respectful with cell phone use while on the fitness floor. Speakerphone is not permitted.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Fitness Floor Age Requirements</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 11 and under are not permitted on the fitness floor</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 12-13 must be supervised by a parent, or accompanied by a 10XTO fitness professional</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 14-15 must have completed a fitness orientation with a 10XTO fitness professional</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Group Fitness Studio Etiquette</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Hot Yoga Studio, Studio X, Strength Zone & Pilates Reformer Studio</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Arrive early - class participation cannot be guaranteed once a class has begun</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Secure all personal items, including fitness bags, in the lockers provided located in the respective changerooms before attending classes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>In consideration of your fellow Members, please refrain from wearing strong perfumes and colognes prior to entering the studios</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ensure cell phones are on silent or turned off during class</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>To ensure that every Member has an exceptional experience, please refrain from carrying on private or personal conversations throughout class</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Water is recommended for all classes. Only non-glass containers are permitted</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Upon completion of the class, please wipe down studio mats and props and return them to the designated area in each studio</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Classes begin promptly at the scheduled time. Late entry will not be permitted once a class is in session. If the sign outside the studio reads "Class in session - Do Not Enter", please wait for the next scheduled session.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Age Requirements</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages under 16 are not permitted in group fitness classes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Hot Yoga Studio Etiquette</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Please remove shoes upon entering the Hot Yoga Studio and store in the designated space provided</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>10XTO mats are available to Members and Guests, however, use of a personal mat is recommended</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>If you must leave practice early, quietly excuse yourself before Savasana (final relaxation) begins</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Wipe down studio mats and props and return them to the designated area in each studio</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 11 and under are not permitted in the hot yoga studio</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 12-13 must be supervised by a parent in classes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Ages 14-15 are permitted in non-heated classes only</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>CONTRAST ZONE</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Etiquette & Policies</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Use at Your Own Risk:A new waiver must be signed prior to accessing the Contrast Zone. Please consult with a healthcare professional before participating. Members must be aware of their own health limitations before using the sauna, cold plunges, or red light therapy services.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Age Requirement:The space is reserved for individuals aged 16 and older.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Attire & Conduct:This is a co-ed space. Appropriate swimwear or athletic wear is required. Please conduct yourself respectfully at all times.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Amenities:Bathing suit spinners and refrigerated eucalyptus towels will be available in each change room to enhance your experience.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Safety & Supervision:The space will be monitored by video for the safety of all participants. A desk and staff will be present outside the Contrast Zone during operating hours.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Quiet Zone:The Contrast Zone is a quiet space. No phone calls or recording is permitted.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Cleanliness:Please sit on a towel at all times when using the sauna or relaxing on the green loungers in the red light zone. Kindly clean up after yourself to maintain a pleasant environment for fellow members.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Water Bottles:No glass or metal water bottles are permitted, as their temperatures cannot be regulated.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Booking Procedures</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Bookings are available via the 10XTO app</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Two tokens: 6-day advance booking + same-day booking opens at 12:01am on the day. Each booking is 45-minutes, beginning on the 00:15 of each hour.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>A no-show fee of $15 will apply.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Same-day bookings are recommended - open at 12:01am the same day.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>You are not required to stay for the full 45-minutes or arrive exactly on time.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>A 15-minute buffer will be set aside between sessions for tidying by our team.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Guests of Members may book same-day access for a fee but must be accompanied by a 10XTO Member.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Women's only Contrast Zone hour on Wednesdays from 7:00pm - 8:15pm and Sundays 4:00pm - 5:15pm.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Dress Code</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Robes, towels, and shower safe/non-slip shoes are required.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>10XTO robes and shower shoes are available for rent at $2 per item, if needed.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Robes and show shoes are available for purchase at the Pro Shop.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>No personal items other than a cell phone are permitted in the sapce.</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Recommended Protocol</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Not sure where to start? try this flow for optimal recovery:​</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Sauna| 12 - 18 minutes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Rinse/Shower</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Cold Plunge| 30 secs - 2 minutes</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Rest| 5 - 8 minutes in a relaxation area</p>
<p style='color: var(--gray-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;'>Red Light Therapy| 15 - 30 minutes</p>
